  "notes": "Native ComfyUI support from v0.38.1. Sizes are its native 1024 and 2048 px buckets (12 steps, euler, CFG 1, as the official template). Text-to-image only; the image edit mode needs the layered JSON prompt the official edit template builds. The template's optional prompt enhancer is left out: write the full prompt. The template's \"comfy kitchen attention\" (int8, GPU-only) is not used either: the image validates every recipe on a CPU ComfyUI, where only PyTorch attention exists. Worth measuring once verified."
